and y, (2) Trhy ∗|M|xihx|M † |y ∗i where y ∗ corresponds to an assignment of an arbitrary

k-bit subset for any k, and (3) sample, given an arbitrary input string |xi, the probability
distribution over outcomes y ∗ of a measurement (in the computational basis) on an arbitrary
