   Note that (3), which corresponds to the final simulation of a quantum computation,
follows from (2) in a fairly straightforward manner (see Ref. [1]) whereas (2) could be strictly
stronger than (1).
   A first observation about the class of allowed gates is that they preserve the parity of an

input bitstring |xi, which is expressed by the fact that the {|00i, |11i} sector is decoupled
from the {|01i, |10i} sector. Note that the overall phase factor eiφ is irrelevant in the
computation.
