With these rules, the three types of interactions H1 , H2 and H3 can be rewritten as (we
omit terms that are proportional to I since they will only add irrelevant phase factors to
the quantum state of the computer):

                                                              5
                                    H1 = 2α1 a†i ai + 2β1 a†i+1 ai+1 ,                                      (10)


                   H2 = α2 (a†i − ai )(a†i+1 + ai+1 ) − β2 (a†i + ai )(a†i+1 − ai+1 ),                      (11)

and

